  "creator": "Hyrox",
  "description": "The standard Hyrox race: eight 1 km runs, each followed by a functional station in a fixed order, roughly 8 km of running plus SkiErg, sled push, sled pull, burpee broad jumps, row, farmers carry, sandbag lunges and wall balls. Loads here are Open division (Pro doubles most of them: 202/152 kg sled push, 153/103 kg sled pull, 2×32/24 kg farmers, 30/20 kg sandbag, 9/6 kg wall ball). Sled weights include the sled. From the 2025/26 season Women Open do 75 wall balls instead of 100.",
